'''Apollo Mission''' (アポロ, ''Aporo'', '''Apollo''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (Sm): Cat Cannon will charge 10 seconds faster.

==Combo==
